  "comments": "<p>A few main groups of die combinations are known.<br><br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - small mashes in \"A\" of HARALD V, large mash in \"A\" of ALT.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - thick script to the motto, small mashes in \"A\" of HARALD V, small mash in \"A\" of ALT.<br>Die <strong>3</strong> - large mashes in \"A\" of HARALD V, large mash in \"A\" of ALT.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619626ca9ce6c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619626ca9ce6c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Die <strong>A</strong> - tops of hammer and pick in mintmark with wedges.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> - tops of hammer and pick in mintmark without wedges.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619626e7605b1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619626e7605b1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1995. Sample picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev. <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619627348409d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619627348409d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1996. Sample picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev. <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61962742e218d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61962742e218d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><strong>3</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1997-1999. Sample picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev. <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619627520263d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619627520263d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><strong>3</strong>+<strong>B</strong>: 2000-2003, 2005-2009. Sample picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev. <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6196275e7ffc4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6196275e7ffc4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1995 blister set mintage of 10.000 included in normal circulation line.</p>",
